  "meta": {
    "about": "The world loaded by cells on the room of the socle (configs/cells.json, web/cells-stations.mjs): three cells around the room (north by distance, east by distance in mode screen, hall by neighbours of the room), each a scene of game.engine put in beside the room by asset.preload 2.1. Data only."
  }
